OL,3,GNEWSAFrom trauma and addiction to
OL,4,A'giving back'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFighting trauma, addiction and
OL,7,Fsurviving months of sleeping rough on
OL,8,Fthe streets of Nottingham, a woman is
OL,9,Fnow hoping to inspire others who are
OL,10,Fstruggling.
OL,12,FLisa Barlow, 47, a former rough sleeper
OL,13,Fturned volunteer, said she wanted to
OL,14,Fgive back after homelessness charity
OL,15,FFramework "helped me change my life".
OL,17,FHer story is part of an exhibition that
OL,18,Faims to provide a deeper understanding
OL,19,Fof the challenges faced by people
OL,20,Fexperiencing homelessness.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
