OL,3,GNEWSAFrom trauma and addiction to
OL,4,A'giving back'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"From trauma to hope to independence"
OL,7,Ffeatures paintings, installations,
OL,8,Fspoken word performance, real-life
OL,9,Ftestimonies and a soundscape of noises
OL,10,Fheard by rough sleepers and opened on
OL,11,FSaturday at Southwell Minster in
OL,12,FNottinghamshire.
